mcp-server-abraflexi (1.5.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Mark attachment download/thumbnail, report export and QR tools as
    read-only (they do not mutate AbraFlexi; local file write only).
  * Implement attachment list/get/download/thumbnail via ReadOnly HTTP
    paths instead of ReadWrite convenience wrappers.
  * Add user_query_list tool; live scenario probes queries, attachments,
    report export and QR against the official FlexiBee demo.
  * Default .env.example to demo.flexibee.eu / company demo; CI runs the
    live capability scenario on every push.

