abraflexi-mcp-server (1.4.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix override_dh_auto_install to pass --destdir=debian/abraflexi-mcp-
    server: without it, pybuild routed the actual Python module into an
    unused debian/python3-abraflexi-mcp-server staging dir once a second
    binary package existed, so 1.4.0-1.4.2 silently shipped an
    abraflexi-mcp-server .deb missing its own code.

