abraflexi-mcp-server (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  [ Vítězslav Dvořák ]
  * Add optional 'company' parameter to evidence_get/evidence_create/
    evidence_update/evidence_delete (and the underlying client
    builders), so a single configured MCP instance can target any
    AbraFlexi company by dbNazev instead of only the one baked into
    ABRAFLEXI_COMPANY - needed for cross-company operations such as
    replicating user access rights (evidence 'uzivatele') from one
    company to another.
  * Fix version mismatch across __init__.py/setup.py/pyproject.toml/
    server.json.

